# Backend API base URL. In production (Cloudflare Pages) this MUST point at
# the public backend domain — Cloudflare Pages does not run the Vercel /api
# proxy, so the app calls the backend directly. Example:
# VITE_API_URL=https://buggumaya.duckdns.org
# Leave empty only for local dev, where vite.config.ts proxies /api.
VITE_API_URL=
VITE_WS_URL=
VITE_OPENCODE_USERNAME=
VITE_OPENCODE_PASSWORD=
